	(descr "Marushin MJ-373/4B mini DIN 4-pin jack (S-Video), PCB mount, hand-soldered (not JLC-assembled). Land pattern per Marushin drawing MJ373/4B-001 \"T:1.6 Dimensions of PC board holes (Printed-Top view)\": 4 holes phi1.2: pin2 (8.5,+3.25) pin4 (11.0,+3.25) pin1 (8.5,-3.25) pin3 (11.0,-3.25); 3 shell/ground slots 2.8x0.8 R0.4: pad5 at (4.7,0) vertical, pad6/pad7 at (5.5,-6.85)/(5.5,+6.85) horizontal. Origin = mating face (x=0) on the centreline (y=0); body 12.7 deep, flange 14.0 wide x 13.0 high. Same housing/land frame as MJ-373/8B. Drawing y is positive upwards; KiCad y is negated here.")
